    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-17947584-33fd-4f01-9bcd-d65c10286142" n="0758" facs="#m-efe913ad-4819-443d-bcba-dd72437caadb" /><div xml:id="m-4c00ffb0-03bd-495f-bfa0-b88dce6bcea3">
            <lg xml:id="m-939c2ab9-4b30-46ad-8ba6-92e6c0bda015">
              <l xml:id="m-1c92d308-1bd2-4c37-8384-f6f992ac24c1" facs="#m-0248450a-3235-4d41-8c2b-bd579c68c96b" label="ambiguous">el2</l><l xml:id="m-35c57374-a34b-415f-93fb-bb42959e1f4f" facs="#m-d0e481b8-5f6a-4a8e-a5ba-757f5c9da823" label="ambiguous">Tuesday in Holy Week</l><l xml:id="m-ff1bfc4d-47df-4741-84f6-1ab708a500a8" facs="#m-4210d1fe-8a52-4401-8457-92b8ed8342de" label="lyrics-like">eo loquénte, venit Judas Isca- fáctum, et per triduum áliud</l><l xml:id="m-2825b577-7dc3-4df6-aace-da5333d46289" facs="#m-67650811-399e-4e90-82b9-136036f79852" label="lyrics-like">riótes, unus de duódecim, et</l><l xml:id="m-092f042e-81ba-4c0f-b2f2-66bca32b37dc" facs="#m-a791e2db-cb16-4a94-ac6a-3ab524c27d84" label="lyrics-like">non manufáctum aedificábo.</l><l xml:id="m-b8fa1cff-3d09-4877-bcbd-c126b792937a" facs="#m-fb02b5c4-e702-4daa-bafa-459157b0a129" label="lyrics-like">cum eo turba multa cum gládiis,</l><l xml:id="m-99f62516-506b-439a-8ae5-2a15ad7014f8" facs="#m-321ef83d-1877-4cf1-aabf-3d54e128e2f9" label="lyrics-like">C. Et non erat convéniens testi¬</l><l xml:id="m-095ee555-f5e4-4363-9109-8714a593d8f3" facs="#m-8f97c0c6-13a1-4d81-a5f4-b5b87c20360c" label="lyrics-like">mónium illórum. Et exsúrgens</l><l xml:id="m-16749780-b37f-4828-bd42-9f8864dd2829" facs="#m-14487c43-c715-4158-a322-76559c60a36d" label="lyrics-like">et lignis, a summis sacerdótibus,</l><l xml:id="m-dcf07a91-e467-4f6a-b949-2070e507579e" facs="#m-a10e1b30-4a97-4781-9672-e28c06318ed2" label="lyrics-like">et scribis, et senióribus. Déderat</l><l xml:id="m-064fc2ba-06c0-4150-a445-072244014f8e" facs="#m-0bea23f3-aa90-4c4f-a10c-007eeb003348" label="lyrics-like">summus sacérdos in médium,</l><l xml:id="m-14cd9027-2a32-4e00-92a5-e1b41638a106" facs="#m-e6bd5485-cc30-4d65-bcaf-7ff3e9fe5be1" label="lyrics-like">interrogávit Jesum, dicens</l><l xml:id="m-69e47ad4-324b-4409-9368-1bd278bcfc9e" facs="#m-1f1069d5-40e3-48b4-a59d-30af3aa414f8" label="ambiguous">:</l><l xml:id="m-83be1c44-1125-4f2a-a7ce-c84936523d64" facs="#m-477f7d43-f24f-4c0a-a939-90a2e08d5bfb" label="lyrics-like">autem tráditor ejus signum eis,</l><l xml:id="m-a1f53ea1-0048-47d6-ab33-77895fea2d44" facs="#m-a635115a-42e5-440f-8688-14c90882ab3a" label="lyrics-like">S. Non respóndes quidquam ad</l><l xml:id="m-1d36cf81-7bc9-4b65-b799-3187d42d2c0f" facs="#m-dddc60da-9fd8-4f79-9499-a5d939b94ae4" label="lyrics-like">dicens: S. Quemcúmque oscu¬</l><l xml:id="m-6a05c867-4718-4492-bc7a-abe05fb73b67" facs="#m-dc981eb5-e10b-448c-85fe-3ed28609ddec" label="lyrics-like">látus fúero, ipse est, tenéte eum,</l><l xml:id="m-98e0df55-68d2-4113-9c4e-b0b239f5c2cb" facs="#m-45bdeae7-45e7-4c38-bb9c-f915ba2f755f" label="lyrics-like">ea, quae tibi objiciúntur ab his?</l><l xml:id="m-18d6230a-d406-4c0b-9715-35c16b3b119a" facs="#m-115aa87f-c2a6-4245-945f-37f90a661d67" label="lyrics-like">et dúcite caute. C. Et cum</l><l xml:id="m-36c83ad3-70bc-4ac8-86cd-ea68af6fa614" facs="#m-00391426-6806-4725-9894-b90c811564a1" label="lyrics-like">C. Ille autem tacébat et nihil</l><l xml:id="m-0c0433df-1cbd-46c1-bc05-cb2fabb0a24f" facs="#m-6022a713-29f8-4c55-ba8e-45609020e9af" label="lyrics-like">venisset, statim accédens ad</l><l xml:id="m-ffcb9292-764b-4555-b614-b24e3a52c978" facs="#m-52da5457-b729-451c-a317-65f14475ccd1" label="lyrics-like">respóndit. Rursum summus sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-fd84d2a9-5272-4681-863d-6608d8a65c0d" facs="#m-23bccfae-1b7f-4a39-99db-2e30a1175ffe" label="ambiguous">eum, ait: S. Ave, Rabbi. C. Et</l><l xml:id="m-dd2de9e3-c315-44dc-a434-00a61c24d163" facs="#m-d5a77472-288e-4a2c-b42b-ed8908490205" label="lyrics-like">cérdos interrogábat eum, et dixit</l><l xml:id="m-0cb6e469-6b54-43f8-97cf-44045b540fcd" facs="#m-07bf6f9c-f391-45ef-902b-c8e1a0d3e0a7" label="ambiguous">el: S. Tu es Christus Filius</l><l xml:id="m-a30b9cc5-3995-44c9-aace-d29845615e9d" facs="#m-3665ab89-4a92-4830-a381-2b3b197571e0" label="lyrics-like">osculátus est eum. At illi manus</l><l xml:id="m-b1c7bf0e-e085-4e06-b143-ee5274833a15" facs="#m-8ca6ce9f-4762-4458-b1b6-ab3135536e3c" label="ambiguous">Dei benedicti? C. Jesus autem</l><l xml:id="m-206137fd-bdd5-47f6-8725-6f922ab87497" facs="#m-560cf74d-5bbd-4498-b7db-18ae67f56eaf" label="lyrics-like">injecérunt in eum, et tenuérunt</l><l xml:id="m-f7a8387b-240f-44db-bac6-0cb92f8108b4" facs="#m-080d734f-6d31-4e83-a4ef-76a834f13637" label="ambiguous">eum. Unus autem quidam de</l><l xml:id="m-7b48b766-5fad-4b6d-8563-c4075358fb36" facs="#m-af534b21-7361-4779-93d1-e5c8679ede64" label="ambiguous">dixit illi: ★ Ego sum: et</l><l xml:id="m-97cdd468-47de-46ea-bd4c-079adabb5312" facs="#m-650ee345-0ac0-4bb8-a9c9-99ed9c4d56c9" label="lyrics-like">vidébitis Filium hóminis sedén¬</l><l xml:id="m-c3d001d4-78e3-4603-91e2-2ac528ea72ee" facs="#m-9a1fe312-4e6b-446a-8055-9b128577d5a1" label="lyrics-like">circumstántibus, edúcens glá¬</l><l xml:id="m-a35199aa-ab8c-4b00-9ccd-13df510fd5d0" facs="#m-704445d4-7257-4748-8486-563f0a54b84a" label="lyrics-like">tem a dextris virtútis Dei, et</l><l xml:id="m-aa39094a-c3e0-4a7b-a318-d86a40370778" facs="#m-faa32df6-92a4-4d62-b12e-fd96c82cdf6c" label="lyrics-like">dium, percússit servum summi</l><l xml:id="m-743c7582-11f7-4d5a-b1ab-7c617d6b712b" facs="#m-aa5f747e-f06f-44f4-a7ea-c6248cae2d6f" label="lyrics-like">sacerdótis: et amputávit illi</l><l xml:id="m-b2d87d27-c2ae-4a16-b331-369716415bdb" facs="#m-0fd3cba9-9300-4950-a0f1-dcdc666e0cfc" label="lyrics-like">veniéntem cum núbibus caeli.</l><l xml:id="m-315129ff-2abe-4cd2-99b1-6f9b7a8fcfc1" facs="#m-25d4e6ad-fd1e-4ca9-8cd7-80ddf0c382c6" label="lyrics-like">C. Summus autem sacérdos</l><l xml:id="m-03d8d573-c73e-451a-9ae7-6cf9e53222fe" facs="#m-112bc6e9-9d19-42d2-b328-72a2f2947050" label="lyrics-like">auriculam. Et respóndens Jesus,</l><l xml:id="m-a7b949e8-0023-4d66-b94b-865765bf6320" facs="#m-66d4668f-365b-40c5-a721-7ea7ced74a61" label="lyrics-like">ait illis:  Tamquam ad latró¬</l><l xml:id="m-a1e3dfbc-c72f-444c-9132-9094a5f376fe" facs="#m-a994e4b3-3077-4afd-9acb-ad5a5f04d6e7" label="lyrics-like">scindens vestiménta sua, ait:</l><l xml:id="m-673472b7-26a5-45a3-bec5-3d429c04d567" facs="#m-0722c376-e9bb-4a29-a54c-b8a08c474b59" label="lyrics-like">s. Quid adhuc desiderámus te¬</l><l xml:id="m-defbdb38-4430-4e62-940d-6efb92a52289" facs="#m-931fbc28-a364-4e9e-8e18-0ff6c72cd601" label="lyrics-like">nem existis cum gládiis et lignis</l><l xml:id="m-aff01210-6d09-4308-8791-6f224f9893e8" facs="#m-ba8acd7f-6425-41c7-a350-35b99d6b1f31" label="lyrics-like">stes? Audistis blasphémiam:</l><l xml:id="m-5d4935f8-13f2-4713-ad4c-d579084cd86d" facs="#m-b18c8b59-739e-4ac4-9270-98f5ebc09db9" label="lyrics-like">comprehéndere me? quotidie</l><l xml:id="m-755aa70a-e6da-4c91-9528-4354f0c61e0c" facs="#m-27ba12ed-9386-4a74-8de9-67c57f175112" label="lyrics-like">quid vobis vidétur? C. Qui</l><l xml:id="m-1b95a5cf-6d18-4702-9f10-94adb73f1d90" facs="#m-ad4bca99-1991-43b4-a5d9-2b2dc779e567" label="ambiguous">eram apud vos in templo docens,</l><l xml:id="m-32d7fe78-513f-4658-87c7-42aaaa6c8c59" facs="#m-6c3a0165-176e-4b62-b90a-a5f7942e8645" label="ambiguous">et mon me tenuistis. Sed ut</l><l xml:id="m-bd934f46-cd5c-4d0d-9bf4-18e75291d004" facs="#m-2d58381b-865a-45e9-b13b-d264295cbde4" label="lyrics-like">omnes condemnavérunt eum esse</l><l xml:id="m-fa1e1cd0-313a-43b6-9075-212a32de2ec8" facs="#m-edd89cfb-a477-4056-ac30-f4a34f104a70" label="lyrics-like">impleántur Scriptúrae. C. Tunc</l><l xml:id="m-d702b98c-bd47-4dcc-b4c9-76bf07b3c1ad" facs="#m-bb135a0e-aa06-49b1-b201-d1e2105423a0" label="ambiguous">reum mortis.</l><l xml:id="m-37a14176-d665-4c72-be55-7349a7f7dcf2" facs="#m-2cdb54a0-fa20-4c7f-aec7-fcf21b3f8527" label="lyrics-like">discípuli ejus relinquéntes eum,</l><l xml:id="m-4e832d63-4627-4172-856d-62f4f2c1b5c8" facs="#m-4a364142-57c9-46af-a7c6-00d1d89be08c" label="lyrics-like">Et cœpérunt quidam conspúere</l><l xml:id="m-c281654f-d961-4639-8952-79dc06f685b4" facs="#m-aff9d6a8-bbad-495f-900c-150d54608bdb" label="lyrics-like">eum, et velare fáciem ejus, et</l><l xml:id="m-4ed52111-226a-4c0d-a232-06e02e3b54ff" facs="#m-4ae82e0a-84e3-40e4-9057-52c6aa3aea9e" label="lyrics-like">omnes fugérunt. Adoléscens</l><l xml:id="m-2dcd5ee1-c8b0-4706-914c-cb0e96625408" facs="#m-88c9224a-fd77-4944-a7b7-1bde663df443" label="lyrics-like">cólaphis eum caédere, et dícere</l><l xml:id="m-f9c5fe4c-dad7-49a9-af19-d6159518db9f" facs="#m-d21e9a42-e805-4e20-af25-fe4cb4f6e59d" label="lyrics-like">autem quidam sequebátur eum</l><l xml:id="m-9be1b1a0-5d72-4c41-ad98-48f98a811715" facs="#m-1596664a-4f7c-4bd4-8ce0-a56cde8086dd" label="lyrics-like">ei: S. Prophetiza. C. Et miní¬</l><l xml:id="m-35fecd7b-562d-4ddf-8dba-d21af8fcc15c" facs="#m-e0dfcbbc-00d9-4ba9-83c1-6e6b1adcddeb" label="lyrics-like">amíctus síndone super nudo:</l><l xml:id="m-c0916b75-8066-4fb6-9b97-062d44f297ab" facs="#m-a035d9b6-6b91-45ed-9b31-1f75a27e6dd8" label="lyrics-like">stri álapis eum caedébant.</l><l xml:id="m-2d28d322-8830-4331-b9d7-f4a105d36953" facs="#m-74bf5d86-57de-44f0-b448-fdffdafd46e6" label="lyrics-like">et tenuérunt eum. At ille, rejécta</l><l xml:id="m-524a3dba-e80a-4267-a406-ecc1d0585d53" facs="#m-af9f2f5a-8c3c-4b01-8142-6081f103e091" label="lyrics-like">sindone, nudus profúgit ab eis.</l><l xml:id="m-39e0a2dd-d9d8-4cfe-b23b-60b70a39c860" facs="#m-76b547a6-fd89-423f-bca4-ca347f401313" label="lyrics-like">Et cum esset Petrus in átrio</l><l xml:id="m-fd217e70-7a00-460b-bb12-b8348ca12b4f" facs="#m-fdc618bb-9784-4a17-9c5a-29c163791440" label="lyrics-like">Et adduxérunt Jesum ad sum¬</l><l xml:id="m-ed24d248-2c08-484e-b188-05e19ce318cb" facs="#m-99538b56-f82f-425e-a702-ae61f999e35d" label="lyrics-like">deórsum, venit una ex ancillis</l><l xml:id="m-a8bc6f63-2a92-4127-9a50-4e1d526b73e8" facs="#m-f1dd9436-cc53-4416-a587-f0f9aa51c21c" label="lyrics-like">summi sacerdótis: et cum vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-90507b82-46b6-4f79-bb8d-d0a9bfd9f959" facs="#m-9e6006ba-4198-49c1-8646-eacb9ab9de16" label="lyrics-like">mum sacerdótem: et convené¬</l><l xml:id="m-1a89609c-d2da-4774-aa07-6ed91d712e2e" facs="#m-b4440984-194a-43de-a898-fad6973ccfcb" label="lyrics-like">disset Petrum calefaciéntem se,</l><l xml:id="m-36f2dd75-4337-4234-b593-d9c320ffdb02" facs="#m-faf7c74c-32fb-4b25-85b5-5f2b6461a025" label="lyrics-like">runtomnes sacerdótes, et scribae,</l><l xml:id="m-2ae31423-3907-49f8-b648-55b5f2da676a" facs="#m-01feb3b8-7277-40f1-8122-b84d9e247915" label="lyrics-like">aspíciens illum, ait : S. Et tu</l><l xml:id="m-7bfc8d24-e34c-4a28-9557-dff8f2f369c7" facs="#m-6f7cffb8-a497-41ca-9326-a8ea71fabd6d" label="lyrics-like">et senióres. Petrus autem a longe</l><l xml:id="m-a63f0718-a98a-4da9-b722-3e29fb26b8d3" facs="#m-a5647049-3146-43be-b6dd-55fabe793975" label="lyrics-like">cum Jesu Nazaréno eras. C. At</l><l xml:id="m-9e256e59-85e5-49ac-ab84-e0a3593cab40" facs="#m-ef2c0135-d229-41d3-ba3e-d043c2753129" label="lyrics-like">secútus est eum usque intro in</l><l xml:id="m-40ca2cfe-e0d2-4568-afe5-575c7b90f691" facs="#m-58c6cf0f-a91e-4bbd-a568-efedb3ea8334" label="lyrics-like">átrium summi sacerdótis : et se¬</l><l xml:id="m-295b809a-fdfd-4219-8674-cdf620ee8daf" facs="#m-5eb9ede4-70b2-4ea1-925f-3bb4334ac0eb" label="lyrics-like">ille negávit, dicens: S Neque</l><l xml:id="m-daeb047d-0b00-4053-92b6-f6d665a71299" facs="#m-386c6040-6609-4e02-a5b4-7d0a4e7e2eb8" label="lyrics-like">débat cum ministris ad ignem,</l><l xml:id="m-993686f9-c93b-4fc7-b5be-2601fcaeedc6" facs="#m-77631c90-dcda-43ce-a504-6c2575488ddc" label="ambiguous">scio, neque novi quid dicas.</l><l xml:id="m-bcc123b7-3750-4a91-a3dd-818571302cd5" facs="#m-b6709cd0-5e1b-4b39-9401-c57726689352" label="lyrics-like">et calefaciébat se. Summi vero</l><l xml:id="m-47f5de0d-d084-4af0-9702-9e1e52eaf390" facs="#m-7ca7e607-9ef4-4afb-89b8-3f4ecc169081" label="lyrics-like">C. Et éxiit foras ante átrium,</l><l xml:id="m-db2bf881-9a55-4f4e-bd3a-b893e3085e7f" facs="#m-28985bb3-e402-4ced-ad32-66ab174a0db4" label="lyrics-like">sacerdótes, et omne concslium,</l><l xml:id="m-3401170b-109b-4431-a45e-10ef6ab7d531" facs="#m-11fc1982-4c33-4871-ae1b-c006437b7c82" label="lyrics-like">et gallus cantávit. Rursus autem</l><l xml:id="m-84ba07d8-ea51-4914-b9c5-41178bdc6e5f" facs="#m-a21a919a-42e4-4ce9-abd9-373f2de57ee0" label="lyrics-like">quærébant advérsus Jesum te¬</l><l xml:id="m-d5c946df-992f-49c9-add5-d7beb40a0acf" facs="#m-65214b34-e63d-43e8-9ece-e155890e3b27" label="lyrics-like">cum vidísset illum ancilla, cœpit</l><l xml:id="m-9eea432e-ee37-4eb7-8636-e5947e6aeb37" facs="#m-9685401c-a784-481d-b2cf-627a4e65a6f4" label="lyrics-like">stimónium, ut eum morti tráde¬</l><l xml:id="m-66c0e013-6704-428d-9620-502a8b8ae8c5" facs="#m-72f12b0f-c2c6-42b5-9583-f7214119f35d" label="lyrics-like">dicere circumstántibus: Quia</l><l xml:id="m-9bbe775a-a9dd-4506-98ad-daae8e03282d" facs="#m-337cdbba-a588-4d61-bccd-56721189c59a" label="lyrics-like">rent, nec inveniébant. Multi</l><l xml:id="m-5258710b-45b7-4ef0-992a-6ed740cae94d" facs="#m-86a91469-ff06-4876-b4d9-5150e1ca03a6" label="text-like">hic ex illis est. At ille iterum</l><l xml:id="m-3db34659-10ef-4431-b7df-ea64f2e890b9" facs="#m-c51afffc-857c-4546-af7e-81714cebd5dc" label="lyrics-like">enim testimónium falsum dicé¬</l><l xml:id="m-06441b52-d25d-4a6c-8f39-b68a27bc1118" facs="#m-9bbee47a-ae2b-400c-8c1a-ed6809a56774" label="lyrics-like">negávit. Et post pussllum rursus</l><l xml:id="m-cfa018b6-9a3d-426d-bd70-2e9aaebbf59b" facs="#m-3a9c3266-531d-4055-bc48-161a40bbc7ca" label="lyrics-like">bant advérsus eum: et conve¬</l><l xml:id="m-125d0275-36d7-402a-bb81-0d2295be487b" facs="#m-91c9e08e-0b2a-4f9f-9da8-31445eb7f4d8" label="lyrics-like">qui astábant, dicébant Petro:</l><l xml:id="m-b9d0d9a3-70b7-46d2-bc18-0d3b590d2195" facs="#m-21186f61-1a6a-4fc8-bf75-753f31e9d7a9" label="lyrics-like">niéntia testimónia non erant.</l><l xml:id="m-0e6ecbc9-295c-4432-be7a-afd7e1082568" facs="#m-65b637bb-8b07-4792-8037-5aa3ec6a8a5f" label="ambiguous">S. Vere ex illis es: nam et</l><l xml:id="m-7bcdb7fc-e0ec-473e-84ea-4123de09681f" facs="#m-a4464010-f77d-421b-b6f3-aaf8f1e84e88" label="lyrics-like">Et quidam surgéntes, falsum</l><l xml:id="m-a6286cd1-ece6-4a56-a35f-d346ecc9a56e" facs="#m-95362e5e-9f14-4ab9-8487-608099b9ae93" label="lyrics-like">Galilaéus es. C. Ille autem cœpit</l><l xml:id="m-dc442d81-6285-4820-afb4-7bd5976b370b" facs="#m-a7130c62-8c00-40c5-816b-b5d3b0029b03" label="lyrics-like">testimónium ferébant advérsus</l><l xml:id="m-2a10020c-5c6d-4847-87d0-02411da62665" facs="#m-96f4446c-8451-4f99-8aca-5f9c041bbdc0" label="lyrics-like">anathematizáre, et juráre: Quia</l><l xml:id="m-369b3e71-367f-42cd-8ef7-51c5cc63abf4" facs="#m-dd43e325-9d4d-4585-8786-05300df3cd2d" label="lyrics-like">eum, dicéntes: S. Quóniam nos</l><l xml:id="m-1ece551a-3133-4cc9-b140-e8869e7184d0" facs="#m-e5161d99-9025-4aa3-bbae-2c505964fc3b" label="lyrics-like">néscio hóminem istum, quem</l><l xml:id="m-a7281c0d-5931-4027-9998-5aa4616ebb4c" facs="#m-9ffc8726-a22c-49fe-9e30-f681fa5e9fde" label="ambiguous">dicitis. Et statim gallus iterum</l><l xml:id="m-4abe04a0-898e-4e73-8da8-54798e7e2843" facs="#m-c83c2db8-1927-49db-bb62-5f28e3176e2a" label="lyrics-like">audivimus eum dicéntem: Ego</l><l xml:id="m-3b5c5f15-9ca4-4741-ba48-5b494166a175" facs="#m-a53ff39c-cf82-4f20-bdaa-181e5d5e1031" label="lyrics-like">dissólvam templum hoc manu-cantávit. Et recordátus est Pe¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>